*  m1_nodefer_ALT.sno -- FINDING-2026-08-17-s139 sec.2 table, row 5 (nodefer_ALT).
*
*  Same alternation Sp = SPAN(' ') | LEN(0) as m1_defer_ALT.sno, defined as
*  its own statement, but Command references it UNDEFERRED (plain Sp, not
*  *Sp) -- isolates "an ALT-valued pattern variable in ARBNO body position"
*  from "an ALT reached THROUGH a defer".  STANDING GREEN COUNTER-WITNESS.
*  Oracle (SPITBOL x64 sbl -b): ok.  scrip HEAD @ s139: ok (already passes).
         &ANCHOR      =  1
         Word         =  SPAN('ABCDEFGHIJKLMNOPQRSTUVWXYZ')
         Sp           =  SPAN(' ') | LEN(0)
         Command      =  Word Sp
         L            =  ARBNO(*Command)
         Src          =  'START HERE'
         Src          POS(0) L RPOS(0)                            :F(FA)
         OUTPUT       =  'ok'                                     :(END)
FA       OUTPUT       =  'FAIL'
END
